-*   `--in <input volume>`: Input file path. [S1, unofficial]
-*   `--res <x> <y> <z>`: Grid resolution. [S1, unofficial]
-*   `--dim <x> <y> <z>`: Voxel scale. Default: `(1, 1, 1)`. [S1, unofficial]
